[I] A multiple repository management tool

[T] myrepos provides the mr command, a tool by Joey Hess to manage all your
[T] version control repositories, for example to update or push all of them
[T] at once. It supports git, svn, mercurial, bzr, darcs, cvs, fossil and
[T] veracity and allows custom per repository commands.

[U] https://git.joeyh.name/git/myrepos.git

